{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/569db1cc1d446adf19e295d051b20e1c.webp?t=1770684155\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms: Escape Together is a co-op survival horror game featuring lifelike graphics, proximity voice chat and horrifying entities. You and up to 5 friends must make your way through 10 fully procedurally generated levels using what's available to you to progress deeper into the Backrooms. <br><br>Every level is a mini-adventure of its own, hosting\u00a0unique gameplay, puzzles, lootable items, environments, and entities.\u00a0<strong>Levels will be added constantly throughout early access as we grow the game into the best multiplayer experience to date.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/4f0dcce46172c6682b483b7527f0ec56.webp?t=1770684155\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is re-generated on the fly after every level attempt. No two rooms, hallways, or encounters are the same offering unparalleled replay-ability. Each level's procedural generation algorithm is meticulously designed to capture the essence of the Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/d1d31d0fd91df0d062e776911039355a.poster.avif?t=1770684155\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/d1d31d0fd91df0d062e776911039355a.webm?t=1770684155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/d1d31d0fd91df0d062e776911039355a.mp4?t=1770684155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/322e15d1b8f9314ac52efb00d10deecd.webp?t=1770684155\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in Unreal Engine 5, Backrooms: Escape Together's lifelike visuals and spatialized audio work to remove every possible immersion barrier between you and the game. You will feel as if you truly are a lost wander, stuck in the Backrooms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/7486db898e6dd0b61a2b4dbdd9020be4.poster.avif?t=1770684155\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/7486db898e6dd0b61a2b4dbdd9020be4.webm?t=1770684155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/7486db898e6dd0b61a2b4dbdd9020be4.mp4?t=1770684155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/64ffa700d25065ee8489bb8ef0b0c9f6.webp?t=1770684155\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Backrooms alone or team up with 5 others for a total of 6-player co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy hilarious tension relieving moments as you watch your friends die from the horrors you encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic proximity voice chat adapts to walls, rooms, and new environments on the fly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host private lobbies for your friends only or join a public lobby for an adventure with a stranger</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/01b6af01bdb932388c10ec451fab6dae.poster.avif?t=1770684155\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/01b6af01bdb932388c10ec451fab6dae.webm?t=1770684155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/01b6af01bdb932388c10ec451fab6dae.mp4?t=1770684155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/acb2516b558885e8b2fef3d31e064013.webp?t=1770684155\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every entity, level, exit, and design decision has been based on the online lore of the Backrooms. We take lore accuracy seriously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a team of researchers, you are tasked to explore the liminal labyrinth. However, after completing your research duties, an elevator malfunction leaves you with only 2 objectives, survival and escape.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/b02d09f81640f696896f1edb70dbc612.poster.avif?t=1770684155\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/b02d09f81640f696896f1edb70dbc612.webm?t=1770684155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/b02d09f81640f696896f1edb70dbc612.mp4?t=1770684155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141730/85d5a5b3efdfffc253e5a1d994aa0a7cb2b47c49.jpg"},{"name":"Covenant of Thieves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141730/4b574bd2f029219a75e4374e454c54c2b2ea5691.jpg"},{"name":"Rust and Rend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141730/c5f0f9e8070e64f9d99b42504b5280849a0832f2.jpg"},{"name":"Clerical Desolation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141730/3746b66ebd56fab46565e78bc12330fb33729b56.jpg"},{"name":"Abyssal Echoes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141730/6ffe64ccec9abe31b6a4adb5760f52b2c2a9526a.jpg"},{"name":"A Tranquil Sojourn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141730/08e6d52f77f2520adff58b5dfe9e458f55c6f15c.jpg"},{"name":"Footsteps in Limbo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141730/49889a84e2af18971d6f8d084b9187cbdde48981.jpg"},{"name":"The Commencement","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141730/b89081951415fd0b4da87e8cf645986eb442b802.jpg"},{"name":"Level 1 (Purgatory)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141730/1933718fbe0f02ae8f00baa7295349dfa45b06ed.jpg"},{"name":"Level 2 (Purgatory)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2141730/0428fd4e63170a47ea265605f6d18fd6d06bd31a.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2141730?t=1770684155","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770684155","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/dcc2e9cc8d5c08bae8b72bc266592434ecd24425/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770684155","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/dcc2e9cc8d5c08bae8b72bc266592434ecd24425/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770684155","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/569db1cc1d446adf19e295d051b20e1c.webp?t=1770684155\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms: Escape Together is a co-op survival horror game featuring lifelike graphics, proximity voice chat and horrifying entities. You and up to 5 friends must make your way through 10 fully procedurally generated levels using what's available to you to progress deeper into the Backrooms. <br><br>Every level is a mini-adventure of its own, hosting\u00a0unique gameplay, puzzles, lootable items, environments, and entities.\u00a0<strong>Levels will be added constantly throughout early access as we grow the game into the best multiplayer experience to date.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/4f0dcce46172c6682b483b7527f0ec56.webp?t=1770684155\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is re-generated on the fly after every level attempt. No two rooms, hallways, or encounters are the same offering unparalleled replay-ability. Each level's procedural generation algorithm is meticulously designed to capture the essence of the Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/d1d31d0fd91df0d062e776911039355a.poster.avif?t=1770684155\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/d1d31d0fd91df0d062e776911039355a.webm?t=1770684155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/d1d31d0fd91df0d062e776911039355a.mp4?t=1770684155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141730/extras/322e15d1b8f9314ac52efb00d10deecd.webp?t=1770684155\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in Unreal Engine 5, Backrooms: Escape Together's lifelike visuals and spatialized audio work to remove every possible immersion barrier between you and the game. You will feel as if you truly are a lost wander, stuck in the Backrooms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop play